{
 "cells": [
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 0. Setup",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 0.1 Load packages",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "Quiet[Remove[\"DCTDataImport`*\", \"NNLSFit`*\", \"DCTKernel`*\", \"DCT`*\",\r\n             \"DCTPlots`*\", \"DCTPeakAnalysis`*\", \"DCTSensitivity`*\",\r\n             \"DCTBiophysics`*\", \"DCTAdmittanceStats`*\", \"DCTKKCheck`*\"]];\r\n$ContextPath = Select[$ContextPath, !StringMatchQ[#, \"DCT*\" | \"NNLSFit*\"] &];\r\nGet[\"c:\\\\Users\\\\Bob Lansdorp\\\\Documents\\\\DCT\\\\DCT.wl\"]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-print-output\"><div class=\"wl-print-line\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered wl-lb-pending\" data-lb-id=\"lb-mq9d9wq5-0yd0hfm\" data-page-width-em=\"107\" data-latex-b64=\"XHRleHRjb2xvcnsjMDBmZjAwfXtcdGV4dHvinJQgRENUIHBhY2thZ2UgbG9hZGVkLn19\" style=\"opacity:0.65;transition:opacity 0.35s\"><div class=\"wl-lb-content\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\" style=\"color:#00ff00;\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:#00ff00;\">✔ DCT package loaded.</span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Print: [formula]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "121dd91e-ef2f-4fda-868b-851d83f28f3c"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 0.2 Parameters",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* \\[Dash]\\[Dash] PARAMETERS \\[Dash]\\[Dash] edit these, then re-run this cell \\[Dash]\\[Dash] *)\r\n\r\n(* Data directories *)\r\ndataDir           = \"c:\\\\Users\\\\Bob Lansdorp\\\\Documents\\\\DCT\\\\data\\\\drift_03252026\";   (* drift data – E1/E2/E3 subdirs *)\r\nconcentrationDir  = \"c:\\\\Users\\\\Bob Lansdorp\\\\Documents\\\\DCT\\\\data\\\\spike\";              (* titration 1 \\[Rule] electrodes 1-3 *)\r\nconcentrationDir2 = \"C:\\\\Users\\\\Bob Lansdorp\\\\Documents\\\\DCT\\\\data\\\\2026-02-25-titration\"; (* titration 2 \\[Rule] electrodes 4-6 *)\r\n\r\n(* Debugging \\[Dash] use only every Nth file to run faster; set to 1 for the full dataset *)\r\ndebugDecimationFactor = 1;\r\n\r\n(* Fit parameters \\[Dash] tuned on drift data in Sections 1\\[Dash]3, locked here for all fits.\r\n   fMinHz is set automatically by Section 1.3 from the Lin-KK population analysis. *)\r\nlambdaND      = 1*^-3;  (* Tikhonov regularisation \\[Dash] from L-curve analysis *)\r\nfMaxHz        = 1000.;  (* upper frequency cutoff [Hz] *)\r\nweightPower   = -1.0;  (* admittance weight exponent *)\r\nbinsPerDecade = 15;     (* tau grid density *)\r\ntauMinFactor  = 0.1;    (* tau grid lower extension factor *)\r\ntauMaxFactor  = 10.;    (* tau grid upper extension factor *)\r\n\r\n(* Natural sort: group by electrode subdir, then by numeric file number.\r\n   Plain Sort gives lexicographic order (118 before 15) which breaks time ordering. *)\r\nsortFiles[files_List] := SortBy[files,\r\n  {FileNameTake[#, {-2}],\r\n   Last[ToExpression /@ StringCases[FileNameTake[#], NumberString], 0]} &]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Method Validation (synthetic recovery)\n\nA known 3-peak g(k) distribution is forward-modelled to an EIS spectrum (SimulateEIS) over a wide synthetic frequency comb, then re-inverted with the same solver used on the real data (DCTSpectrumData). The top panel overlays **recovered** vs **simulated** g(k) — they should coincide (recovered slightly smoothed by Tikhonov regularisation), confirming the inversion recovers a known input. The lower panels show the simulated Bode magnitude and phase.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Known 3-peak g(k) (equal heights) -> forward EIS -> re-invert -> overlay.\n   Uses the same fit parameters as the real-data analysis. *)\n\n(* \"True\" distribution: three EQUAL Gaussian peaks (in log k) at k = 10, 100, 1000 /s *)\nsimTau  = 10.^Range[-4., 0., 1./binsPerDecade];   (* tau grid; k = 1/tau *)\nsimK    = 1. / simTau;\npeakKs  = {10., 100., 1000.};   peakSig = 0.15;   peakAmp = 1.*^-7;\ngSim    = peakAmp * Total[Exp[-((Log10[simK] - Log10[#])^2) / (2 peakSig^2)] & /@ peakKs];\nsimRs   = 50.;   simC0 = 1.*^-7;\n\n(* Forward model -> EIS over a wide synthetic frequency comb (noise-free) *)\nsimFreq = 10.^Range[-1., 5., 0.1];\nsimZ    = DCTKernel`SimulateEIS[gSim, simTau, simRs, simC0, simFreq];\n\n(* Re-invert with the same solver/params used on the real data *)\nsimRec  = DCT`DCTSpectrumData[simFreq, simZ,\n   \"FMinUse\" -> Min[simFreq], \"FMaxUse\" -> Max[simFreq],\n   \"BinsPerDecade\" -> binsPerDecade, \"LambdaND\" -> lambdaND, \"WeightPower\" -> weightPower,\n   \"TauMinFactor\" -> tauMinFactor, \"TauMaxFactor\" -> tauMaxFactor];\n\nDCTPlots`PlotCombValidation[simK, gSim, simRec]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"932633\" data-output-id=\"1\" data-out-n=\"46\" data-sub-idx=\"12\" data-output-format=\"Auto\" data-output-is-graphics=\"1\" data-cell-idx=\"6\" data-sub-start=\"20\" data-sub-end=\"20\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[46]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><span class=\"vscode-wolfram-gfx-marker\" style=\"display:none;\"></span><img class=\"vscode-wolfram-svg-output\" data-wl-img=\"c:\\Users\\Bob Lansdorp\\Documents\\DCT\\img\\EAB_DCT_analysis\\wl_1qxvqmpu789id.svg\" src=\"img/EAB_DCT_analysis/wl_1qxvqmpu789id.svg\"/></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "(* output: graphics *)\n(* Known 3-peak g(k) (equal heights) -> forward EIS -> re-invert -> overlay.\n   Uses the same fit parameters as the real-data analysis. *)\n\n(* \"True\" distribution: three EQUAL Gaussian peaks (in log k) at k = 10, 100, 1000 /s *)\nsimTau  = 10.^Range[-4., 0., 1./binsPerDecade];   (* tau grid; k = 1/tau *)\nsimK    = 1. / simTau;\npeakKs  = {10., 100., 1000.};   peakSig = 0.15;   peakAmp = 1.*^-7;\ngSim    = peakAmp * Total[Exp[-((Log10[simK] - Log10[#])^2) / (2 peakSig^2)] & /@ peakKs];\nsimRs   = 50.;   simC0 = 1.*^-7;\n\n(* Forward model -> EIS over a wide synthetic frequency comb (noise-free) *)\nsimFreq = 10.^Range[-1., 5., 0.1];\nsimZ    = DCTKernel`SimulateEIS[gSim, simTau, simRs, simC0, simFreq];\n\n(* Re-invert with the same solver/params used on the real data *)\nsimRec  = DCT`DCTSpectrumData[simFreq, simZ,\n   \"FMinUse\" -> Min[simFreq], \"FMaxUse\" -> Max[simFreq],\n   \"BinsPerDecade\" -> binsPerDecade, \"LambdaND\" -> lambdaND, \"WeightPower\" -> weightPower,\n   \"TauMinFactor\" -> tauMinFactor, \"TauMaxFactor\" -> tauMaxFactor];\n\nDCTPlots`PlotCombValidation[simK, gSim, simRec]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "ba86116a-3545-4126-8879-58f086abee05"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Simulated vs extracted parameters + % error.\n   Peak area = trapezoid of g over log10 k; central k = arg max,\n   in windows split at the valleys 10^1.5, 10^2.5. *)\nkEdges = {0., 10.^1.5, 10.^2.5, Infinity};\nwindowStat[kv_, gv_, lo_, hi_] := Module[{o, ks, gs, sel},\n  o = Ordering[kv];  ks = kv[[o]];  gs = gv[[o]];\n  sel = (lo <= # < hi &) /@ ks;  ks = Pick[ks, sel];  gs = Pick[gs, sel];\n  {ks[[First @ Ordering[gs, -1]]],\n   If[Length[gs] < 2, 0., Total[(Most[gs] + Rest[gs]) / 2 * Abs[Differences[Log10[ks]]]]]}\n];\nsimStats = Table[windowStat[simK, gSim, kEdges[[i]], kEdges[[i + 1]]], {i, 3}];\nextStats = Table[windowStat[1./simRec[\"Tau\"], simRec[\"g\"], kEdges[[i]], kEdges[[i + 1]]], {i, 3}];\n\nrows = {\n  {\"Rs (Ohm)\",         simRs,                  simRec[\"Rs\"]},\n  {\"Cd = C0 (nF)\",     simC0 1.*^9,            simRec[\"C0\"] 1.*^9},\n  {\"Peak 1 k (1/s)\",   simStats[[1, 1]],       extStats[[1, 1]]},\n  {\"Peak 2 k (1/s)\",   simStats[[2, 1]],       extStats[[2, 1]]},\n  {\"Peak 3 k (1/s)\",   simStats[[3, 1]],       extStats[[3, 1]]},\n  {\"Peak 1 area (nF)\", simStats[[1, 2]] 1.*^9, extStats[[1, 2]] 1.*^9},\n  {\"Peak 2 area (nF)\", simStats[[2, 2]] 1.*^9, extStats[[2, 2]] 1.*^9},\n  {\"Peak 3 area (nF)\", simStats[[3, 2]] 1.*^9, extStats[[3, 2]] 1.*^9}\n};\n\n(* 4th column = signed percent error: 100 (extracted - simulated) / simulated.\n   Assigned to validationTable so Section 6 can export it. *)\nvalidationTable = Grid[\n  Prepend[\n    (Append[#, 100. (#[[3]] - #[[2]]) / #[[2]]] & /@ rows) /. x_?NumericQ :> NumberForm[N[x], {6, 2}],\n    Style[#, Bold] & /@ {\"Quantity\", \"Simulated\", \"Extracted\", \"% error\"}\n  ],\n  Alignment -> {{Left, Right, Right, Right}},\n  Dividers  -> {None, {2 -> True}},\n  Spacings  -> {3, 0.6},\n  BaseStyle -> {FontFamily -> \"Arial\", FontSize -> 13}\n];\nvalidationTable",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"932633\" data-output-id=\"2\" data-out-n=\"53\" data-sub-idx=\"8\" data-output-format=\"SVGT\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"7\" data-sub-start=\"36\" data-sub-end=\"36\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[53]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><img class=\"vscode-wolfram-png-output\" data-wl-img=\"c:\\Users\\Bob Lansdorp\\Documents\\DCT\\img\\EAB_DCT_analysis\\wl_qk7jnyxa0izm.png\" src=\"img/EAB_DCT_analysis/wl_qk7jnyxa0izm.png\"/></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      }
     ],
     "id": "8564739d-77ae-4bbc-b897-f1cc310e1d2a"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 1. Kramers-Kronig Data Validation\nRuns linearized Kramers-Kronig on **all** drift files. A histogram of valid lower bounds across the population guides `fMinHz` selection via `kkFMinPercentile` (params). The representative file residuals plot gives a qualitative view of data quality.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 1.1 File list",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Section 1 parameters *)\nkkResidualThreshold = 0.02;  (* point-by-point |residual|/|Y| threshold; try 0.05 if fMinHz is too high *)\nkkFMinPercentile    = 50;    (* percentile of fMin distribution across files; 50 = median *)\n\n(* Representative file index — residuals plot only; fMinHz comes from the full population *)\nrepFileIdx = 1;\n\n(* Load drift files (every debugDecimationFactor-th file, for fast debugging) *)\ndriftFiles = sortFiles[FileNames[\"*.txt\", dataDir, Infinity]][[;; ;; debugDecimationFactor]];\nPrint[\"Found \", Length[driftFiles], \" drift files (every \", debugDecimationFactor, \"th) in \", FileNameTake[dataDir]];\n\n(* Run linearized Kramers-Kronig on every file — basis for population-level fMinHz *)\nPrint[\"Running Lin-KK on all files...\"];\nkkAllResults = Map[DCTKKCheck`KKCheck[DCTDataImport`ImportEIS[#]] &, driftFiles];\nnPass = Count[kkAllResults, _?(#[\"OK\"] &)];\nPrint[nPass, \" / \", Length[kkAllResults], \" files pass Lin-KK overall.\"];\n\n(* Residuals plot for the representative file *)\nkkRep   = kkAllResults[[repFileIdx]];\nrepFile = driftFiles[[repFileIdx]];\nPrint[Style[\n  \"Rep file (\" <> FileNameTake[repFile] <> \"):  RMS Re = \" <>\n  ToString[NumberForm[100. kkRep[\"RMSRe\"], {4,2}]] <> \"%,  Im = \" <>\n  ToString[NumberForm[100. kkRep[\"RMSIm\"], {4,2}]] <> \"%  \" <>\n  If[kkRep[\"OK\"], \"\\[Checkmark] OK\", \"\\[Times] FAIL\"],\n  Bold, If[kkRep[\"OK\"], Darker[Green], Red], 13\n]];\nDCTPlots`PlotKKResiduals[kkRep]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-print-output\"><div class=\"wl-print-line\"><span class=\"wl-ps\">Found </span><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered wl-lb-pending\" data-lb-id=\"lb-mq9da0yp-f2ralo3\" data-page-width-em=\"106\" data-latex-b64=\"NDU4\" style=\"opacity:0.65;transition:opacity 0.35s\"><div class=\"wl-lb-content\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">458</span></span></span></span></span></div></div><span class=\"wl-ps\"> drift files (every </span><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered wl-lb-pending\" data-lb-id=\"lb-mq9da0yq-141a99x\" data-page-width-em=\"106\" data-latex-b64=\"MQ==\" style=\"opacity:0.65;transition:opacity 0.35s\"><div class=\"wl-lb-content\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></div></div><span class=\"wl-ps\">th) in </span><span class=\"wl-ps\">drift_03252026</span></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Print: Found[formula] drift files (every[formula]th) indrift_03252026",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "688935d8-e329-4421-90fd-1660afa4f2e9"
    },
