  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 4a. Drift Plots\nRun each cell independently. `goodSpecs` must exist (run the fit cell above first).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 4a.1 g(k) by electrode",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* DCT spectrum — g(k) for E1 only, sorted by file number (= time order).\n   Legend = elapsed time at 6 h marks; y-axis in nF/decade. *)\ne1Specs = SortBy[\n  Select[goodSpecs, FileNameTake[#[\"File\"], {-2}] === \"E1\" &],\n  Last[ToExpression /@ StringCases[FileNameTake[#[\"File\"]], NumberString], 0] &\n];\nDCTPlots`PlotGK[e1Specs, DCTPlots`HourMarkLabels[e1Specs], \"GScale\" -> 1*^9]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"932633\" data-output-id=\"11\" data-out-n=\"104\" data-sub-idx=\"2\" data-output-format=\"SVG\" data-output-is-graphics=\"1\" data-cell-idx=\"45\" data-sub-start=\"6\" data-sub-end=\"6\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[104]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><span class=\"vscode-wolfram-gfx-marker\" style=\"display:none;\"></span><img class=\"vscode-wolfram-svg-output\" data-wl-img=\"c:\\Users\\Bob Lansdorp\\Documents\\DCT\\img\\EAB_DCT_analysis\\wl_1g2n059y3wz4a.svg\" src=\"img/EAB_DCT_analysis/wl_1g2n059y3wz4a.svg\"/></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "(* output: graphics *)\n(* DCT spectrum — g(k) for E1 only, sorted by file number (= time order).\n   Legend = elapsed time at 6 h marks; y-axis in nF/decade. *)\ne1Specs = SortBy[\n  Select[goodSpecs, FileNameTake[#[\"File\"], {-2}] === \"E1\" &],\n  Last[ToExpression /@ StringCases[FileNameTake[#[\"File\"]], NumberString], 0] &\n];\nDCTPlots`PlotGK[e1Specs, DCTPlots`HourMarkLabels[e1Specs], \"GScale\" -> 1*^9]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "bae955a4-c683-4b04-815f-9ec0dcd0166b"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 4a.2 Cumulative capacitance",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Cumulative capacitance vs k *)\nDCTPlots`PlotCumulative[goodSpecs]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"932633\" data-output-id=\"12\" data-out-n=\"105\" data-sub-idx=\"1\" data-output-format=\"SVG\" data-output-is-graphics=\"1\" data-cell-idx=\"47\" data-sub-start=\"1\" data-sub-end=\"1\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[105]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><span class=\"vscode-wolfram-gfx-marker\" style=\"display:none;\"></span><img class=\"vscode-wolfram-svg-output\" data-wl-img=\"c:\\Users\\Bob Lansdorp\\Documents\\DCT\\img\\EAB_DCT_analysis\\wl_fq678z0n876r.svg\" src=\"img/EAB_DCT_analysis/wl_fq678z0n876r.svg\"/></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "(* output: graphics *)\n(* Cumulative capacitance vs k *)\nDCTPlots`PlotCumulative[goodSpecs]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "eb182860-1d58-43b2-8f70-6e5dcd040c76"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 4a.3 Nyquist + Bode",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Nyquist + Bode for a single file — change index as needed *)\ni = 40; (* <── change this to pick a different file *)\nDCTPlots`PlotBode[goodSpecs[[i, \"Spec\"]]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"932633\" data-output-id=\"13\" data-out-n=\"107\" data-sub-idx=\"2\" data-output-format=\"SVG\" data-output-is-graphics=\"1\" data-cell-idx=\"49\" data-sub-start=\"2\" data-sub-end=\"2\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[107]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><span class=\"vscode-wolfram-gfx-marker\" style=\"display:none;\"></span><img class=\"vscode-wolfram-svg-output\" data-wl-img=\"c:\\Users\\Bob Lansdorp\\Documents\\DCT\\img\\EAB_DCT_analysis\\wl_18u0b8ex91n6u.svg\" src=\"img/EAB_DCT_analysis/wl_18u0b8ex91n6u.svg\"/></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "(* output: graphics *)\n(* Nyquist + Bode for a single file — change index as needed *)\ni = 40; (* <── change this to pick a different file *)\nDCTPlots`PlotBode[goodSpecs[[i, \"Spec\"]]]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "e1326d86-7ef9-436d-816f-14797d93c243"
