  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 5.3 Area-normalised g(k)",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Concentration g(k) — area-normalised (each curve divided by its integrated capacitance) *)\nconcE1 = Select[concGoodSpecs, StringStartsQ[#File, \"E1\"] &];\nDCTPlots`PlotGK[concE1, Automatic, \"AreaNorm\" -> True]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"932633\" data-output-id=\"18\" data-out-n=\"124\" data-sub-idx=\"2\" data-output-format=\"SVG\" data-output-is-graphics=\"1\" data-cell-idx=\"64\" data-sub-start=\"2\" data-sub-end=\"2\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[124]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><span class=\"vscode-wolfram-gfx-marker\" style=\"display:none;\"></span><img class=\"vscode-wolfram-svg-output\" data-wl-img=\"c:\\Users\\Bob Lansdorp\\Documents\\DCT\\img\\EAB_DCT_analysis\\wl_14rhtreksdsqw.svg\" src=\"img/EAB_DCT_analysis/wl_14rhtreksdsqw.svg\"/></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "(* output: graphics *)\n(* Concentration g(k) — area-normalised (each curve divided by its integrated capacitance) *)\nconcE1 = Select[concGoodSpecs, StringStartsQ[#File, \"E1\"] &];\nDCTPlots`PlotGK[concE1, Automatic, \"AreaNorm\" -> True]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "dbb26189-3af2-43bf-9328-3462b4529914"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 5.4 Fraction folded",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Fraction folded vs [vancomycin].\n   k_peak shifts from the unbound population (range 1) to the bound/folded population (range 2).\n   ff = area(range 2) / (area(range 1) + area(range 2)) \\[Dash] naturally 0 to 1. *)\n\nareaWindow[spec_, kLo_, kHi_] := Module[{tau, g, k, logK, n},\n  tau = spec[\"Tau\"]; g = spec[\"g\"]; k = 1./tau; logK = Log10[k]; n = Length[g];\n  If[n < 2, Return[0.]];\n  Total @ Table[If[0.5(k[[j]]+k[[j+1]]) >= kLo && 0.5(k[[j]]+k[[j+1]]) <= kHi,\n    0.5(g[[j]]+g[[j+1]]) Abs[logK[[j+1]]-logK[[j]]], 0.], {j, n-1}]\n];\n\ngetLabelUM[lbl_] := ToExpression @ First[StringCases[lbl, n:NumberString ~~ \" \\[Mu]M\" :> n], \"0\"];\n\n(* one {conc, ff} list per electrode (concElectrodes = E1..E6 from the fit cell) *)\nffPerElectrode = Table[\n  Module[{subs, concs, a1, a2, ff},\n    subs  = Select[concGoodSpecs, StringStartsQ[#File, e] &];\n    concs = N @ (getLabelUM /@ subs[[All, \"File\"]]);\n    a1    = areaWindow[#Spec, kPeakRanges[[1,1]], kPeakRanges[[1,2]]] & /@ subs;\n    a2    = areaWindow[#Spec, kPeakRanges[[2,1]], kPeakRanges[[2,2]]] & /@ subs;\n    ff    = MapThread[If[#1+#2 > 0., #2/(#1+#2), 0.] &, {a1, a2}];\n    Transpose[{concs, ff}]\n  ],\n  {e, concElectrodes}\n];\n\n(* per-electrode: drop 0 \\[Mu]M for the log-x plots (electrodes have different conc grids) *)\nffPos = Select[#, First[#] > 0 &] & /@ ffPerElectrode;\ncHi   = Max[Flatten[ffPerElectrode[[All, All, 1]]]] * 1.1;\n\ndarkBg  = GrayLevel[0.12];\nfgStyle = Directive[White, AbsoluteThickness[1.1]];\neCols   = Directive[ColorData[97][#], AbsoluteThickness[1.8]] & /@ Range[Length[concElectrodes]];\n\nListLinePlot[ffPos,\n  ScalingFunctions -> {\"Log10\", None},\n  Joined -> False, PlotMarkers -> {Automatic, 10}, PlotStyle -> eCols,\n  FrameTicks -> {{DCTPlots`ThemeLinTicks[0., 1., White], None}, {DCTPlots`ThemeLogTicks[0.8, cHi, White], None}},\n  FrameTicksStyle -> Directive[White, 12],\n  Frame -> True, Axes -> False, Background -> darkBg, FrameStyle -> fgStyle,\n  LabelStyle -> Directive[White, 14, FontFamily -> \"Arial\"],\n  FrameLabel -> {Style[\"[Vancomycin] (\\[Mu]M)\", 14, White], Style[\"Fraction folded\", 14, White]},\n  PlotRange -> {{0.8, cHi}, {0, 1}},\n  PlotRangePadding -> Scaled[0.04],\n  ImageSize -> 500, AspectRatio -> 0.75,\n  PlotLegends -> Placed[LineLegend[eCols, concElectrodes,\n    LabelStyle -> Directive[White, 12], Background -> darkBg,\n    LegendFunction -> (Framed[#, Background->darkBg, FrameStyle->fgStyle]&)], Right]\n]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"932633\" data-output-id=\"19\" data-out-n=\"133\" data-sub-idx=\"11\" data-output-format=\"SVG\" data-output-is-graphics=\"1\" data-cell-idx=\"66\" data-sub-start=\"34\" data-sub-end=\"48\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[133]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><span class=\"vscode-wolfram-gfx-marker\" style=\"display:none;\"></span><img class=\"vscode-wolfram-svg-output\" data-wl-img=\"c:\\Users\\Bob Lansdorp\\Documents\\DCT\\img\\EAB_DCT_analysis\\wl_15i9jvrj95oms.svg\" src=\"img/EAB_DCT_analysis/wl_15i9jvrj95oms.svg\"/></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "(* output: graphics *)\n(* Fraction folded vs [vancomycin].\n   k_peak shifts from the unbound population (range 1) to the bound/folded population (range 2).\n   ff = area(range 2) / (area(range 1) + area(range 2)) \\[Dash] naturally 0 to 1. *)\n\nareaWindow[spec_, kLo_, kHi_] := Module[{tau, g, k, logK, n},\n  tau = spec[\"Tau\"]; g = spec[\"g\"]; k = 1./tau; logK = Log10[k]; n = Length[g];\n  If[n < 2, Return[0.]];\n  Total @ Table[If[0.5(k[[j]]+k[[j+1]]) >= kLo && 0.5(k[[j]]+k[[j+1]]) <= kHi,\n    0.5(g[[j]]+g[[j+1]]) Abs[logK[[j+1]]-logK[[j]]], 0.], {j, n-1}]\n];\n\ngetLabelUM[lbl_] := ToExpression @ First[StringCases[lbl, n:NumberString ~~ \" \\[Mu]M\" :> n], \"0\"];\n\n(* one {conc, ff} list per electrode (concElectrodes = E1..E6 from the fit cell) *)\nffPerElectrode = Table[\n  Module[{subs, concs, a1, a2, ff},\n    subs  = Select[concGoodSpecs, StringStartsQ[#File, e] &];\n    concs = N @ (getLabelUM /@ subs[[All, \"File\"]]);\n    a1    = areaWindow[#Spec, kPeakRanges[[1,1]], kPeakRanges[[1,2]]] & /@ subs;\n    a2    = areaWindow[#Spec, kPeakRanges[[2,1]], kPeakRanges[[2,2]]] & /@ subs;\n    ff    = MapThread[If[#1+#2 > 0., #2/(#1+#2), 0.] &, {a1, a2}];\n    Transpose[{concs, ff}]\n  ],\n  {e, concElectrodes}\n];\n\n(* per-electrode: drop 0 \\[Mu]M for the log-x plots (electrodes have different conc grids) *)\nffPos = Select[#, First[#] > 0 &] & /@ ffPerElectrode;\ncHi   = Max[Flatten[ffPerElectrode[[All, All, 1]]]] * 1.1;\n\ndarkBg  = GrayLevel[0.12];\nfgStyle = Directive[White, AbsoluteThickness[1.1]];\neCols   = Directive[ColorData[97][#], AbsoluteThickness[1.8]] & /@ Range[Length[concElectrodes]];\n\nListLinePlot[ffPos,\n  ScalingFunctions -> {\"Log10\", None},\n  Joined -> False, PlotMarkers -> {Automatic, 10}, PlotStyle -> eCols,\n  FrameTicks -> {{DCTPlots`ThemeLinTicks[0., 1., White], None}, {DCTPlots`ThemeLogTicks[0.8, cHi, White], None}},\n  FrameTicksStyle -> Directive[White, 12],\n  Frame -> True, Axes -> False, Background -> darkBg, FrameStyle -> fgStyle,\n  LabelStyle -> Directive[White, 14, FontFamily -> \"Arial\"],\n  FrameLabel -> {Style[\"[Vancomycin] (\\[Mu]M)\", 14, White], Style[\"Fraction folded\", 14, White]},\n  PlotRange -> {{0.8, cHi}, {0, 1}},\n  PlotRangePadding -> Scaled[0.04],\n  ImageSize -> 500, AspectRatio -> 0.75,\n  PlotLegends -> Placed[LineLegend[eCols, concElectrodes,\n    LabelStyle -> Directive[White, 12], Background -> darkBg,\n    LegendFunction -> (Framed[#, Background->darkBg, FrameStyle->fgStyle]&)], Right]\n]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "db057b8a-7d86-4f55-9d57-0139e52301c4"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 5a. Biophysical Model Fits\n\nFits the mechanistic kinetic model to fraction-folded vs concentration data pooled across all electrodes.\n\n**3-state model** (U ↔ F ↔ B): all aptamers can fold. Parameters: K_S (structural switching equilibrium), K_D (ligand dissociation constant). Baseline ff at zero ligand is K_S / (1 + K_S).\n\n**4-state model** (U ↔ F ↔ B + NF non-folding): fraction NF is permanently unfolded regardless of ligand. Parameters: K_S, K_D, NF. The 4-state K_D is typically much smaller than the 3-state K_D because NF absorbs the saturation shortfall rather than inflating K_D.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 5a.1 Fit and log-linear plot",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Biophysical model fits using the mechanistic 3-state and 4-state kinetic models.\n   Data: {conc \\[Mu]M, ff} across all electrodes, positive concentrations only. *)\n\n(* --- model equations --- *)\nPrint[Style[\"3-state model  (U \\[LeftRightArrow] F \\[LeftRightArrow] B)\", Bold, 13]];\nPrint[Row[{\"  \", Subscript[\"f\",\"f\"], \" = \", DCTBiophysics`$FF3State}]];\nPrint[Style[\"4-state model  (U \\[LeftRightArrow] F \\[LeftRightArrow] B,  NF non-folding)\", Bold, 13]];\nPrint[Row[{\"  \", Subscript[\"f\",\"f\"], \" = \", DCTBiophysics`$FF4State}]];\nPrint[\"\"];\n\nallPts = Flatten[ffPos, 1];   (* all electrodes, conc > 0 *)\n\nfitResult = DCTBiophysics`FitFoldedFraction[allPts];\n\n(* --- fit parameters --- *)\nModule[{p3 = fitResult[\"Model3\"], p4 = fitResult[\"Model4\"]},\n  Print[Style[\"3-state model\", Bold, 13]];\n  Print[Row[{\"  \", Subscript[\"K\",\"S\"], \" = \", NumberForm[p3[\"KS\"], {4,3}],\n             \"     \", Subscript[\"K\",\"D\"], \" = \", NumberForm[p3[\"KD\"], {6,1}], \" \\[Mu]M\"}]];\n  Print[Style[\"4-state model\", Bold, 13]];\n  Print[Row[{\"  \", Subscript[\"K\",\"S\"], \" = \", NumberForm[p4[\"KS\"], {4,3}],\n             \"     \", Subscript[\"K\",\"D\"], \" = \", NumberForm[p4[\"KD\"], {6,1}], \" \\[Mu]M\",\n             \"     NF = \", NumberForm[p4[\"NF\"], {3,2}]}]]\n];\n\n(* --- plot --- *)\nModule[{ks3, kd3, ks4, kd4, nf4, m3, m4, tMin, tMax, c3pts, c4pts,\n        darkBg, fgStyle, eCols, modelStyles},\n  ks3 = fitResult[\"Model3\", \"KS\"];  kd3 = fitResult[\"Model3\", \"KD\"];\n  ks4 = fitResult[\"Model4\", \"KS\"];  kd4 = fitResult[\"Model4\", \"KD\"];\n  nf4 = fitResult[\"Model4\", \"NF\"];\n  m3 = DCTBiophysics`$FF3State /. {DCTBiophysics`KS -> ks3, DCTBiophysics`KD -> kd3};\n  m4 = DCTBiophysics`$FF4State /. {DCTBiophysics`KS -> ks4, DCTBiophysics`KD -> kd4, DCTBiophysics`NF -> nf4};\n\n  tMin = Log10[Min[allPts[[All,1]]] * 0.4];\n  tMax = Log10[Max[allPts[[All,1]]] * 3.];\n  c3pts = Table[{10^t, N[m3 /. DCTBiophysics`conc -> 10^t]}, {t, tMin, tMax, (tMax-tMin)/200}];\n  c4pts = Table[{10^t, N[m4 /. DCTBiophysics`conc -> 10^t]}, {t, tMin, tMax, (tMax-tMin)/200}];\n\n  darkBg     = GrayLevel[0.12];\n  fgStyle    = Directive[White, AbsoluteThickness[1.1]];\n  eCols      = Directive[ColorData[97][#], AbsoluteThickness[1.8], Opacity[0.65]] & /@ Range[Length[concElectrodes]];\n  modelStyles = {Directive[GrayLevel[0.65], Dashed, AbsoluteThickness[2.]], Directive[White, AbsoluteThickness[2.]]};\n\n  ListLinePlot[\n    Join[ffPos, {c3pts, c4pts}],\n    ScalingFunctions -> {\"Log10\", None},\n    (* data series = points only; the two model curves stay joined as lines *)\n    Joined -> Join[ConstantArray[False, Length[concElectrodes]], {True, True}],\n    PlotMarkers -> Join[ConstantArray[{Automatic, 10}, Length[concElectrodes]], {None, None}],\n    PlotStyle -> Join[eCols, modelStyles],\n    FrameTicks -> {{DCTPlots`ThemeLinTicks[0., 1., White], None}, {DCTPlots`ThemeLogTicks[0.8, cHi, White], None}},\n    FrameTicksStyle -> Directive[White, 12],\n    Frame -> True, Axes -> False, Background -> darkBg, FrameStyle -> fgStyle,\n    LabelStyle -> Directive[White, 14, FontFamily -> \"Arial\"],\n    FrameLabel -> {Style[\"[Vancomycin] (\\[Mu]M)\", 14, White], Style[\"Fraction folded\", 14, White]},\n    PlotRange -> {{0.8, cHi}, {0, 1}},\n    PlotRangePadding -> Scaled[0.04],\n    ImageSize -> 540, AspectRatio -> 0.75,\n    PlotLegends -> Placed[LineLegend[eCols, concElectrodes,\n      LabelStyle -> Directive[White, 12], Background -> darkBg,\n      LegendFunction -> (Framed[#, Background->darkBg, FrameStyle->fgStyle]&)], Right],\n    Epilog -> {\n      {Directive[GrayLevel[0.65], Dashed, AbsoluteThickness[2.]], Line[{Scaled[{0.58, 0.91}], Scaled[{0.67, 0.91}]}]},\n      Text[Style[\"3-state model\", GrayLevel[0.65], 11, FontFamily -> \"Arial\"], Scaled[{0.79, 0.91}]],\n      {Directive[White, AbsoluteThickness[2.]], Line[{Scaled[{0.58, 0.83}], Scaled[{0.67, 0.83}]}]},\n      Text[Style[\"4-state model\", White, 11, FontFamily -> \"Arial\"], Scaled[{0.79, 0.83}]]\n    }\n  ]\n]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-print-output\"><div class=\"wl-print-line\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered wl-lb-pending\" data-lb-id=\"lb-mq9dbdp3-4aij9nf\" data-page-width-em=\"106\" data-latex-b64=\"XG1hdGhiZntcdGV4dHszLXN0YXRlIG1vZGVsICAoVSAkXGxlZnRyaWdodGFycm93JCBGICRcbGVmdHJpZ2h0YXJyb3ckIEIpfX0=\" style=\"opacity:0.65;transition:opacity 0.35s\"><div class=\"wl-lb-content\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">3-state model (U </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">↔</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"> F </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">↔</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"> B)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Print: [formula]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
